values (
  'retina-retinal-cell-types',
  $t$Retinal cell types$t$,
  $t$The retina in cross-section: highlight each cell class (photoreceptors, horizontal, bipolar, amacrine and ganglion cells) and each layer.$t$,
  $t$Stuart Trenholm$t$,
